them down into dust!

00:08:41.390 --> 00:08:46.520
It’s all up to you, we don’t care what
you do with it as long as you pay for it!

00:08:46.520 --> 00:08:51.020
ITEM#662 - “The Butler’s Hand Bell”
Just ring the bell and put your feet up.

00:08:51.020 --> 00:08:55.980
Mr. Deeds, the world’s finest butler, will
