00:10:11.470 --> 00:10:13.680
NOTE: OUT OF STOCK DUE TO SUPPLY CHAIN TAMPERING.

00:10:13.680 --> 00:10:18.529
ITEM#1370 - “Pesterbot”
A little toy with a big personality!

00:10:18.529 --> 00:10:23.320
Perfect for any retro toy collector or kids
